# Build-engine manifest — SHA-256 of every REPRODUCIBILITY-ENGINE file in the Project Origin
# corpus toolkit (the code that PRODUCES the published corpus). Non-producing tooling is
# excluded — see ENGINE_EXCLUDE in verify_engine.py — so routine monitoring changes do not move
# it. Scope covers scripts/ AND schema/: the schemas and the AKN registry determine what the
# engine emits, so a change there MUST move the fingerprint. Paths are repo-relative.
# Regenerate with:  python3 verify_engine.py --generate
# Verify with:      python3 verify_engine.py
